{"2175160":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tirade","steam_appid":2175160,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Chess LARP<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a grandmaster who has already achieved everything and is now kicking back, upgrading chess tables and collecting trading cards. No need to think through every move, no need to work out a strategy. Just. Upgrade. Chess.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/878e8867e5460a806fd620aaff82f955.poster.avif?t=1793743524\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/878e8867e5460a806fd620aaff82f955.webm?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/878e8867e5460a806fd620aaff82f955.mp4?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >40 awesome cards!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching chess play itself is fun, sure, but it's way more fun to upgrade it with awesome collectible cards!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/828d49e12ca4a35bc8dcdf41244cdcda.poster.avif?t=1793743524\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/828d49e12ca4a35bc8dcdf41244cdcda.webm?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/828d49e12ca4a35bc8dcdf41244cdcda.mp4?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Upgraded Upgrades<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossbreed the cards you get, then perform a blood ritual to upgrade your new card. Then toss the leftover cards into the shredder and upgrade your upgraded card. WE NEED MORE UPGRADES!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/aff413fd585f56c5469df4f4b595ba0d.poster.avif?t=1793743524\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/aff413fd585f56c5469df4f4b595ba0d.webm?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/aff413fd585f56c5469df4f4b595ba0d.mp4?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You don't need to know how to play chess<\/li><li>If you know how to play chess, you don't need to play it here<\/li><li>If you want to learn chess, now's the time (we sure can't play)<\/li><li>40 awesome artifact cards to upgrade your game<\/li><li>780 artifact combinations<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Chess LARP<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a grandmaster who has already achieved everything and is now kicking back, upgrading chess tables and collecting trading cards. No need to think through every move, no need to work out a strategy. Just. Upgrade. Chess.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/878e8867e5460a806fd620aaff82f955.poster.avif?t=1793743524\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/878e8867e5460a806fd620aaff82f955.webm?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/878e8867e5460a806fd620aaff82f955.mp4?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >40 awesome cards!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching chess play itself is fun, sure, but it's way more fun to upgrade it with awesome collectible cards!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/828d49e12ca4a35bc8dcdf41244cdcda.poster.avif?t=1793743524\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/828d49e12ca4a35bc8dcdf41244cdcda.webm?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/828d49e12ca4a35bc8dcdf41244cdcda.mp4?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Upgraded Upgrades<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossbreed the cards you get, then perform a blood ritual to upgrade your new card. Then toss the leftover cards into the shredder and upgrade your upgraded card. WE NEED MORE UPGRADES!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/aff413fd585f56c5469df4f4b595ba0d.poster.avif?t=1793743524\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/aff413fd585f56c5469df4f4b595ba0d.webm?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/extras\/aff413fd585f56c5469df4f4b595ba0d.mp4?t=1793743524\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You don't need to know how to play chess<\/li><li>If you know how to play chess, you don't need to play it here<\/li><li>If you want to learn chess, now's the time (we sure can't play)<\/li><li>40 awesome artifact cards to upgrade your game<\/li><li>780 artifact combinations<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"An idle clicker about playing on 16 chessboards at once. Do you know how to play chess? You won't need it here.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/b38f34865e505fd5577fea4fa14640c2ba2b5601\/header.jpg?t=1793743524","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/275d3022bce85a533e594fdf7e92c3ce896355bb\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793743524","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2175160\/275d3022bce85a533e594fdf7e92c3ce896355bb\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793743524","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-3220 \/ AMD FX-4100<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 3 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated - Intel HD Graphics 4000 \/ AMD Radeon HD 6000 (1 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 6